      "message": "If the user specifies `--rw`, `self.args.ro` will be False and this will fall back to `flash_npcx_all` (writing the whole chip) instead of just the RW region.\n\nIf `--rw` is not supported over NPCX JTAG, consider raising an error here explicitly so the user is aware:\n```python\n        if getattr(self.args, \"rw\", False):\n            raise ValueError(\"--rw is not supported over NPCX JTAG\")\n        proc \u003d \"flash_npcx_ro\" if self.args.ro else \"flash_npcx_all\"\n```",
